window.products.push({"id":887046,"name":"53mm Espresso Tamper, Spring-loaded Coffee Tamper with Wooden Handle,100% Stainless Steel Base Tamper for Barista, Coffee Tamper for Espresso Machines","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HkEgOLlIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HileuYie elegant and innovative espresso tamper with a built-in spring and 100% stainless steel flat bottom surface! Designed for coffee enthusiasts who demand precision and consistency in their brewing, our 53mm tamper ensures the perfect pressure every time. The classic wooden shape and thick handle provide a comfortable and ergonomic grip, while the stainless steel base guarantees a uniform extraction. Why I need a coffee Tamper? Tamping the coffee powder is a crucial step in the espresso brewing process. When coffee grounds are compacted and evenly distributed in the filter basket, it creates a uniform surface area for the water to pass through. This ensures a consistent extraction and optimal flavor in the final cup of espresso. A coffee espresso tamper, like our innovative spring-loaded model, helps to compress the coffee grounds to the ideal density, ensuring a perfect extraction every time. With the help of our espresso tamper, coffee enthusiasts can achieve a more consistent and delicious cup of espresso with less guesswork and more precision. Consistent and Precise Tamping : Built-in spring and 100% stainless steel bottom. The spring mechanism provides consistent pressure and makes tamping easier and more efficient, while the stainless steel base ensures a uniform and level tamp for optimal extraction. With our coffee espresso tamper, you can achieve the perfect extraction every time, enhancing the flavor and aroma of your favorite coffee beans. Elevate Your Coffee Brewing Experience : A classic wooden handle that provides a comfortable and ergonomic grip. The thick feel of the handle offers optimal control and minimizes hand fatigue during use. The natural texture of the wood also adds a touch of elegance to your coffee setup, making it a beautiful and functional addition to any coffee lover's collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HkEgOLlIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HiLeuYie","source_asin":"B0BRJ6R1D1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRJ6R1D1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRJ6R1D1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
