window.products.push({"id":887403,"name":"NAO A Basket for Two Porcelain Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21BNTJN2KTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Nao porcelain sculptures are hand crafted in Valencia, Spain where pioneers in the European porcelain industry have been creating timeless works of art since the company's inception in 1953. This blend of old-world craftsmanship and the latest ceramic technology ensures that each individual Nao sculpture is finished to perfection and will be cherished for generations to come. Nao's extensive collection of more than 300 sculptures captures the unforgettable moments of life including motherhood, weddings, childhood, falling in love, the joy of pets, the beauty of nature, religion and much more. Both gift-givers and discriminating collectors alike will appreciate the quality and attention to detail that signifies each and every Nao sculpture. Nao, part of the Lladro group, is sold in more than 122 countries around the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21BNTJN2KTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NAO","source_asin":"B0001WW32A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001WW32A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001WW32A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":887404,"name":"Cudia Automatic Stainless Steel Soap Dispenser Durable and Touchless, Hand Sanitizer Dispenser Equipped w/Infrared Motion Sensor Waterproof Base suita","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uikARe8DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With this hands free automatic stainless steel soap dispenser , you don't need to touch the soapdispenser. It can be used in a bar, on the countertop, into bathroom very efficient in kitchen as dish soap dispenser. Perfect for your family. OPERATION: *Place the batteries in the waterproof battery compartment .( Batteries are not included ,4 AAA batterries last for about 4 months) *After placing the batteries in the compartment of touchless soap dispenser , unlock the top cover by gently turning it anti-clockwise. * Fill the compartiment with soap, please be sure that the soap is not to thick , add some water to make the soap more liquid. . * To switch on, press and hold the on/off button for few seconds , wait for red light to flash twice witch indicate that the dispenser has been turned on. *To adjust volume of soap dispensed, press on/off button once. * There are 3 adjustable levels to the volume dispensed. Repeat step 4 until the desired volume. *Place your hand under the sensor (light indicator) to dispense soap. INSTRUCTIONS: 🔎1.Do not wash the dispenser. Wipe clean with a damp cloth. 🔎2.Avoid direct sunlight to the infrared panel. 🔎 3.**When first using, please kindly add some water to 'squeeze' out the vacuum air, then add the liquid. 🔎4.**If you pour thick liquid, please add proper diluted water to ensure normal discharge. 🔎5. Please keep the bottom of the automatic soap dispenser dry, do not soak it in water to avoid long-term corrosion and damage the unit. 🔎6.Do not mix old batteries with new batteries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uikARe8DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUDIA","source_asin":"B089X6D3PR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089X6D3PR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089X6D3PR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
