window.products.push({"id":887417,"name":"XFXIA Spice Rack, 4 Tiers 2 Set Clear Acrylic Spice Drawer Organizer with 32 Spice Labels and 100 PCS Double Sided Adhesive Dots, Spice Rack Organizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717SfNXHILL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spice Rack Organizer: The 4-Tier Spice Drawer Organizer saves a lot of storage space in your drawers and cabinets. The included blank spice labels are DIY-able, making it easy to find and get what you need quickly, helping you keep your jars neat and easy to locate 4-Tier Spice Rack: Unique splicing design allows multiple spice drawer organizers to form a solid and flat whole, which is not easy to break down. The complimentary double-sided clear glue dots prevent the spice rack organizer from moving during use, preventing the spice bottle from slipping Expandable Drawer Inserts: Clear acrylic spice rack fits most drawers, cabinets - expandable according to drawer width, it has different sizes for all drawer sizes (adjustable width: 11.8 to 23.6 inches, height: more than 3.5 inches ) 4 layers, 1 set of 4 pieces, 2 sets of 8 pieces in total. Each piece is 11.8\"L x 4.5\"W x 1.7\"H. Capacity: Holds up to 48 spices (be sure to measure the drawer size before buying) Sturdy and easy to install and clean: No tools required, place the spice organizer in kitchen drawers and cabinets and extend it to the most suitable size (can be adjusted left and right and up/down). The Spice Rack Drawer Organizer is made of durable acrylic, sturdy and unbreakable, and supports jars well. Simply clean with mild soap and water Multi-Purpose Organization: Place the spice rack in drawers, cabinets, pantries, shelves, cabinets or countertops, great for storing and organizing spice jars, condiments, vitamins, nail polish, lipstick, perfume or some small bottles, etc Transparent Acrylic Material: Attention! The acrylic spice rack has a protective film on the surface, and you need to tear off the protective film before using it after receiving the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717SfNXHILL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XFXIA","source_asin":"B09XHS7RGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XHS7RGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XHS7RGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
