window.products.push({"id":887531,"name":"2 Pack Pants Hangers Space Saving, 6-Layers Hangers for Pants Scarves, Multifunctional Pant Rack Hanger, Magic Jean Hangers for Closet, Non-Slip Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914Sj5AC1dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨Maximize Your Closet Space - Our 2-pack 6 layers VAYWET pants hangers are the perfect solution to maximize your closet space. They are equivalent to 12-pack regular pants hangers, allowing you to save at least 84% of space in your closet. Transform your wardrobe into a clutter-free haven you can be proud of. Perfect for small closets in apartments, dorms, hotels, and more. 🏠Pants Organizer for Closet - Pants hangers space saving in your closet and keeps your pants, scarves, skirts, shawls, and linen wrinkle-free. Easily hung horizontally for easy access, our pants hangers then drop to a vertical orientation, saving valuable space. Plus, you no longer have to worry about steaming or ironing your clothes before you leave the house. Get organized and have your pants, scarves, and clothing ready to go in no time with VAYWET pants hangers! 👍Sturdy & Durable - Thickened stainless steel pants hangers provide you with a reliable and durable pants hanger organizer that will last. Whether you use it for lightweight scarves storage or heavier pants, VAYWET's multifunctional pants hangers won't collapse or bend. Thanks to its arch reinforcement and Structural Mechanics Design, it's designed for perfect force balance. 🧰Easy to Assemble - The package comes with detailed instructions and all the necessary accessories for installation. It only takes 4 easy steps to get the job done. Even if you're not a handy person, you can assemble the entire hanger in under 5 minutes. Its innovative design allows you to hang pants straight across the bar. 👍Non-slip & Great Grip - Our pant hangers feature a non-slip rubber coating and excellent grip to help keep your pants securely in place. The bars curve up a little at the end, and each one also has a stopper to help keep your garments from slipping off. They're space-saving too, so you can maximize your closet space. 🎁Ideal Gift - Our innovative product maximizes space design concepts, making VAYWET pant hangers stand out. It's elegant and practical, making it the perfect gift for family, friends, travelers, and home lovers. The package includes two 6-layer hangers, saving you the space of 12 hangers! If you're not completely satisfied with your purchase, please don't hesitate to contact us for a solution. We appreciate your business!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914Sj5AC1dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VAYWET","source_asin":"B0BRJD8GN7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRJD8GN7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRJD8GN7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
