window.products.push({"id":887540,"name":"13\" Shabu Hotpot, 304 Food Grade Stainless Steel Soup Cooking Pot Dual sided Pan, GDAE10 Hot Pot Tool Machine for Home Restaurant Kitchen Cookware","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713woT-05bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: Our shabu hot pot is made of food grade 304 stainless steel, which is more durable, easier and faster to heat. Double floor design that could be used more safely, looks great, and doesn't slow down heating performance. The distance between the shingle soldering point was very even, the base pot is very suitable. High key spot welding process, not easy to leak. Safe & Delicate Desige: Soup cooker with double-sided divider that allows you to enjoy two soups with different flavors at the same time. The cookware divider is connected using a spot welding process with high encryption so it is not easy to leak. Raised floor design that could be used more safely, looks great and doesn't slow down heating performance. Handle covered with rubber prevents scalding. Delivery Content: When you buy our Shabu-Hot Pot, you also get 2 soup ladles made of food-grade stainless steel and 1 thickened lid made of tempered glass. Perfect size and set, suitable for family, friendship and hot pot restaurants. Applicable to induction cooker, electric ceramic oven, gas cooker, halogen oven and other ovens. Friendly Tips: 1. Due to the waterproof construction, the S-separator needs to be welded in the middle of the pot so that the weld cannot be covered. 2. The stainless steel pot itself does not turn yellow, black or rusty. This can happen if the heat is too high or if there is oil residue on the outside of the pot. Please clean and dry thoroughly after use, Put in a dry place to avoid residues of cooking oil. Ideal gift: Nice gift for birthday, anniversary, celebrations. Excellent gift for your daughter, mother, grandmother, colleague, partner, student, girlfriend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713woT-05bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GDAE10","source_asin":"B0B5T9V9KK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5T9V9KK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5T9V9KK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":887541,"name":"18 Piece Bath Rug Set Choose from Taupe, Teal Blue, Sage Green, Burgundy Holiday Red Geometric Desin Print Bathroom Rugs Shower Curtain/Rings and Towe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H0Zo2bwNL._AC_SL1089_.jpg","description":"The bath rug set with shower curtain is a stylish and functional bathroom accessory bundle designed to enhance the look and comfort of your bathing space. It includes a coordinating shower curtain and a set of matching bath rugs, creating a cohesive and visually appealing aesthetic. The shower curtain is made from a durable material, typically a blend of polyester. It features a decorative pattern or design that adds a touch of elegance to your bathroom decor. The shower curtain is equipped with metal hooks for easy hanging on a shower rod, allowing it to glide smoothly and remain securely in place. The bath rugs included in the set are designed to complement the shower curtain and tie the overall bathroom theme together. These rugs are made from soft and absorbent materials, such as microfiber, providing a comfortable and plush surface to step on after bathing or showering. They offer a cozy and warm feeling while also absorbing excess water, helping to keep your bathroom floor dry and slip-free. Both the shower curtain and bath rugs in the set are available in a variety of colors, patterns, and sizes to suit different bathroom styles and preferences. Whether you prefer a sleek and minimalist look or a vibrant and bold design, there are options to match your personal taste. In summary, the bath rug set with shower curtain combines functionality, style, and convenience. It elevates the overall appearance of your bathroom, protects your floors from moisture, and provides a comfortable underfoot experience. With this set, you can create a cohesive and inviting atmosphere in your bathing space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H0Zo2bwNL._AC_SL1089_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WPM","source_asin":"B07832B3BC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07832B3BC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07832B3BC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
