window.products.push({"id":887552,"name":"Rachael Ray Stainless Steel 3-Quart Covered Shallow Saucepan, Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318qXd8UiuL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The larger surface area of a shallow saucepan lets sauces and liquids reduce more quickly compared to narrower pans with the same capacity. Amazon.com Part of Rachel Ray's stylish stainless-steel cookware line, this handy 3-quart shallow saucepan is sure to stay in the daily rotation for all kinds of small to medium cooking tasks. Stainless steel heats quickly and evenly, and the aluminum-capped base adds both energy efficiency and improved heat retention. Plus, the metal doesn't react to acidic foods, resists corrosion and scratches, and cleans easily with just a sponge. The pan's curvy shape, with an ample cooking surface, slightly tapered neck, and flared rim, also helps to hold in moisture and flavors, then pours tidily when the food is ready. For cool, sturdy transport, the double-riveted stick handle is arched high and covered with grippy orange silicone that's oven-safe to 400 degrees F. The glass lid keeps the chef informed on what's happening inside, and the high handle protects fingers from the heat. Like the rest of this line, the saucepan glows with a lovely satin finish and has a lifetime limited warranty. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318qXd8UiuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rachael Ray","source_asin":"B000UZTWEU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000UZTWEU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000UZTWEU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
