window.products.push({"id":887564,"name":"Stove Top Grill Plate Copper Non-Stick Smokeless Roasting Round Ceramic BBQ Indoor Kitchen BBQ Grill Pan No Oil or Butter Needed Ceramic coated BBQ De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51loTAvQ2gL._AC_.jpg","description":"NON-STICK COPPER STOVE TOP GRILL SET: Grill plate and dip pan is Dishwasher safe - Works on gas, electric, and propane range stoves -Ceramic coating for high temperature cooking Non-stick surface ensures easy clean-up. No oil or butter needed -PFOA/PFOS/PFTE free -Place the drip pan over burner on the stove and place the grill plate onto the drip pan -Fill the drip pan with water to capture dripping and prevent smoke and splattering during cooking. IDEAL FOR BBQ: The non-stick and smokeless BBQ Grill is great for cooking delicious barbecue meat and vegetable. This helps you to cook or grill easily giving you a perfect blend of taste & evenly cooked food. It is easy to carry and can be used easily for barbeque and won’t be a pain in cleaning or carrying. IDEAL FOR INDOOR & OUTDOOR USE: Round grill plate has no problem in outdoor BBQ. Also you don't need to worry about the weather anymore. Just enjoy your favourite grilled foods any time you want with the Smokeless Stovetop. Barbecue Grill on your electric, gas, or propane stoves inside the house. WATER-FILLED RING DESIGN: Fill the stainless steel drip pan with water, or your favourite marinade to add moisture to your food, absorb fat and juices during cooking, eliminating smoke and splattering, infuse flavour, and prevent drying. SAFE USE & EASY TO CLEAN: - It supports to collect all of the drippings from the food you are cooking, and also can be used to steam flavour into your food. It has a safe, non-stick surface that will allow food to cook quickly without sticking, and that same surface will make it easy to clean afterward. Healthy Cooking for Meat and Vegetable. This non-stick copper stove top grill set includes grill plate and dip pan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51loTAvQ2gL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grand Innovations","source_asin":"B07FL81KTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FL81KTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FL81KTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
