window.products.push({"id":887588,"name":"Le Creuset Enameled Cast Iron Signature Round Dutch Oven, 13.25 qt., Cerise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":479.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cnEYb-GxL._AC_.jpg","description":"Designed specifically to enhance the slow-cooking process by evenly distributing heat and locking in the optimal amount of moisture, the Signature Collection round French Oven blends the best of the past with the latest innovations for comfort and functionality. Handcrafted one at a time inside our Fresnoy-Le-Grand foundry for nearly a century, Le Creuset round French Ovens have been a fixture in homes and restaurants around the world for generations. Their enduring quality, wide-ranging versatility and stylish colors have made them indispensable in the kitchen and cherished around the table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cnEYb-GxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B00DQKGSRK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DQKGSRK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DQKGSRK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":887589,"name":"Mombake Skull Halloween Cupcake Liners Standard Paper Baking Cups Black and White, 100-Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J-MYyo13L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Mombake standard Halloween cupcake liners are featuring these elements - white skulls, orange pumpkin lanterns, white bats and orange stars in all black background, to immerse you deeply in a terrific atmosphere of a Halloween party. Made of food-grade paper, the Halloween baking cups are printed with safe soy inks, ensuring you and your family's health as well as saving you time cleaning the muffin pan. Baking Cupcakes/Muffins: Oven temperature: 350℉/175℃ Baking time: regular sized 18-25 minutes; mini 9-15 minutes Mombake - Thinks like a Mom Love & Responsibility Brand Story The founder of Mombake, Mrs. Shao is a baking enthusiast, also a Mom of 3 lovely kids. She started to bake when her first boy baby was born, and showed growing interest for baking when her second girl baby was born. She practised her baking skills as often as she can while looking after her babies, in order to treat them to sweet cupcakes and yummy biscuits when they grow up. When she saw three small satisfied faces after her deliciously-baked muffins tasted, Mrs. Shao thought everything she had done was worthwhile and gained the motivation to continue to improve. She regards the children's health as her primary responsibility and puts it in the first place. While improving the baking skills, she is very picky about bakeware, and only selecting healthy, environmentally-friendly and quality cupcake liners, muffin pans and other baking tools. Those baked delicious desserts always reminded Mrs. Shao that her mother still remained at the oven in the kitchen, watching the color of the bread on a hot summer day. That's not just bread! Yes, that is the love of a mom. She always remembers her mother's love for her and her love for children; she is crazy about baking. So Mrs. Shao combined \"Mom\" with \"bake\" and created the brand of \"Mombake\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J-MYyo13L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mombake","source_asin":"B07YHSG1N3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YHSG1N3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YHSG1N3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
