window.products.push({"id":887820,"name":"USA Pan Nonstick Round Cake Pan Set of 3, Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71si30-5nFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The USA Pan 3-piece large cake pan set includes one each: 6-inch round cake pan, 8-Inch round cake pan and 10-Inch round cake pan. Our round cake pans can be used to make beautiful, professional quality tiered cakes or each pan stands on its own for individual cakes and desserts: pot pies, mac-n-cheese, frittatas and anything you can dream up. Each cake pan surface is coated with USA Pan’s proprietary AMERICOAT, a patented nonstick silicone, allowing easy release of cakes and even the most delicate of baked goods. The non-stick feature makes clean-up truly effortless. AMERICOAT is also PTFE, PFOA, and BPA free. Every USA Pan is made in the USA from globally sourced materials, and all have been designed with the same standard high performance features which commercial bakers enjoy - including aluminized steel and heavy gauge steel construction that allows for even heat distribution and maximum service life. Our round cake pans are crafted with a unique fluted surface design which facilitates air circulation and even browning. The ridged surface and rolled rims also maximize the pan’s strength, which helps to resist warping. USA Pan’s professional grade bakeware helps everyday home bakers produce professional grade baked goods—our bakeware is long-lasting, durable, reliable. USA Pan is a Bundy Family-owned company, based in the greater Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania area, and has been producing high performance bakeware for over 50 years. Hand wash in warm soapy water with a cloth or sponge and towel dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71si30-5nFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USA Pan","source_asin":"B0B4V6CKNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4V6CKNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4V6CKNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
