window.products.push({"id":887958,"name":"Sphere Ice Cube Mold,3D Skull Ice Cube Mold and Star Wars Ice Molds for Whiskey,3 Different Shapes+1Tray (3 Pack + 1 Tray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518g3Ha5KLL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","description":"Key Features: 1. The whiskey ice mold used in whiskey or cocktails can determine how chilled the beverage is and can affect how appealing it looks in the wine glass. 2. Food grade silicone whiskey ice ball mold, Reusable & BPA Free 3. A tiny funnel makes filling easily without leaking and avoids over-filling. Silicone ice trays won't crack or break like stiff plastic molds after freezing. Soft material and quick open buckle design make release effortlessly. Ice Ball Mold Instructions: 1. Align the ice ball mold lid and press tightly (Just try a few more times and you will become more successful) 2. Inject pure water about 95% (ice ball will expand after freezing, so that the ice ball will be rounder.) 3. Stable put it in the refrigerator and freeze for 4-6 hours (Try not to shake the ice mold after it is filled with water) 4. Leave it for a while after taking it out of the refrigerator, it will easier to take out the ice ball Why Choose A Large Skull Ice Cube Mold -- If you want to enhance the presentation of whiskey you serve to your friends -- Big ice ball is melted more slowly compared to traditional ice cubes. -- The round ice ball could while keeping the drink cold for a longer period of time and ideal for minimal dilution of your drink. Multifunction: 1.The best choice for Whiskey, Cocktail, Brandy, Scotch, Bourbon, Liquor Drink 2. Creates slow melting ice spheres that are perfectfor non-alcoholic beverages, even coffee. freezes pretty much anything including jelly, chocolate. Package Includes: 1. Extra Large Skull Ice Mold   x 1 2. Death Star Ice Cube Mold    x 1 3. Round Ice Sphere Ice Mold  x 1 4. Plastic Tray  x 1 5. Tiny Funnel  x 3","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518g3Ha5KLL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NICITY","source_asin":"B0993XTDQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0993XTDQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0993XTDQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
