window.products.push({"id":887980,"name":"Tovolo Spatulart Skeleton Mini Spatulas - Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M4bzZqvSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Even kitchen tools can be decorative works of art. Tovolo has incorporated fun designs with fade-resistant colors aimed to last. Whether you're baking during the holidays or flipping eggs, Spatula tools are designed for the smile in mind. The high performance silicone heads and fade-proof, stain-resistant silicone ink makes these mini spatulas a functional work of art! The edges are tapered to a sharp point to scrape the side of the bowl completely clean and the square corner will fit into the tightest spots of any pan and the completely smooth surface allows for even spreading. From head to handle's end the spatulas measures 8\"L x 1.7\"W x .6\"H. At Tovolo, we believe time spent cooking should be fun and we are honored to be a part of that experience in each home that uses our products. We challenge ourselves to improve the performance, function, and appearance of kitchen tools. Something as simple as a silicone spatula moves us to create the perfect experience for our customers. We obsess over every detail to ensure that our spatula will outperform expectations. However, performance alone is not enough; we want to put a smile on the customer’s face as well. Whether it is our Spatulart silicone spatulas, our assortment of frozen pop molds or our whimsically shaped ice molds, we strive to add a colorful element of fun to each of our items, to do just that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M4bzZqvSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B00ZIJHRMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-887980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZIJHRMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZIJHRMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
